    <h2>Key Takeaways</h2>
    <ul style="background:#f9f9f9; border-left:4px solid #007acc; padding:12px; border-radius:6px; list-style:disc; margin-left:20px;">
      <li>AI and VR are changing how we interact with the world.</li>
      <li>Tech is both exciting and overwhelming — constant updates keep us on our toes.</li>
      <li>Balance is key: too much screen time can harm focus and growth.</li>
      <li>Stay safe online — avoid scams, suspicious links, and fake promises.</li>
      <li>Patience and learning step by step will help you adapt to new tech.</li>
    </ul>

